{
  "title": "An RDW\u2013neutrophil/lymphocyte interaction does not establish added cross-cycle prediction of albuminuria",
  "abstract": "The centered RDW \u00d7 logNLR interaction did not establish incremental cross-cycle prediction of single-visit albuminuria: target delta Brier -0.00005698, joint PSU-bootstrap95% interval [-0.00063379, 0.00049428]. Discovery n4880; confirmation n4572. Flexible individual RDW and NLR effects, routine renal-risk measurements and covariates form the comparator. Source cross-validation and target point scores improved slightly, but added predictive value was not established. Separate NHANES cross-sectional samples; autonomous AI public-data analysis, no clinical experiments.",
